4. open-claude-ui (https://github.com/Caho1/open-claude-ui), MIT License,
   commit c1f923ae0051a871941b98a0e2e3183a545e6a85.
   Adapted from code-examples/:
   - useClaudeRovingFocus.ts: keyboard navigation in segmented-choice.tsx.
   - ContainerResponsiveBar.tsx: container-aware settings and handoff actions.
   - MediaLightboxViewer.tsx: image zoom anchoring and nearby-image preloading.
   - useClaudeScrollPinning.ts and ScrollFadeContainer.tsx: workbench reading
     position, follow-latest behavior and scroll-edge indicators.
   - ArtifactsSplitPaneResizer.tsx: workbench inspector drag intent, width
     adjustment and gesture rollback.
   - DraggableSessionList.tsx: pinned-session organization, pointer drag intent
     and keyboard reordering, connected to the current visible DSH sessions.
   - ChatMessageBubbles.tsx and CodeBlock.tsx: focused response reading and
     code presentation with copy feedback confirmed by the clipboard result.
   - ChatComposer.tsx and RichComposerWithMentions.tsx: composer action grouping
     and bounded writing-area expansion around the resident DSH editor.
   - ClaudeMotionPresets.ts, ThinkingAccordion.tsx and ConfirmationDialog.tsx:
     finite role transitions, grid-based seat disclosure and dialog arrival.
   The adapters use DSH tokens, native modal handling and existing host state.

